# Placed shapes on the whiteboard, in Inbox/Shapes.canvas, which tests/drive.rs writes first: a
# Venn bound to two volcano queries, a card on Krakatoa, a sticky and an arrow. The Venn shows
# which volcanoes fall in each region; clicking it shows its grips. Its corner stretches it and
# the regions fit again, r turns it, its grip turns it more, and dragging it moves it.
# tests/drive.rs reads the file after.
size 140x44
env COLD_LAVA_EDITOR=none
wait-for example-workspace
keys w
wait-for whiteboards · type to filter · ⏎ open · Esc back
type shapes
keys enter
wait-for whiteboard Shapes · 4 cards · 0 arrows
wait-for Stratovolcanoes
expect-in 20 15 24 82 Mount St. Helens
expect-in 20 15 24 50 Krakatoa
expect-in 20 60 24 82 Mount Fuji
expect-in 2 90 12 125 Krakatoa
expect - [ ] Pack ash masks
click 24 26
wait-for shape venn2 · Simple Venn diagram  600×600  0 arrows
expect-in 4 48 4 48 ↻
expect-in 38 82 38 82 ◆
# The bottom-right corner, dragged up and left: smaller, and the regions fit again.
drag 38 82 32 70
wait-for shape venn2 · Simple Venn diagram  495×489  0 arrows
expect-in 17 15 22 70 Mount St. Helens
expect-in 4 42 4 42 ↻
# The grip, dragged to the right of the centre: a quarter turn.
drag 4 42 18 75
wait-for 495×489  turned 90°  0 arrows
keys r
wait-for 495×489  turned 105°  0 arrows
# The body, dragged down: it moves.
drag 20 42 24 42
wait-for shape venn2
keys q
wait-for cold-lava workspaces
keys q
exits 0
